[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/4331424023","html_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/issues/5203#issuecomment-4331424023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/5203","id":4331424023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLj5faM8AAAABAixJFw","user":{"login":"ClassicLarry","id":42926649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTI2NjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42926649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry","html_url":"https://github.com/ClassicLarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T00:21:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T00:21:11Z","body":"🤖 **Gate 1 Results: AdamH Embed with init std=1.0 (macro_loss)**\n\nBoth runs finished.\n\n| Dim | Run | macro_loss | tps | tps ratio | Eff Speedup |\n|-----|-----|-----------|-----|-----------|-------------|\n| 512 | baseline | 3.8104 | 405,630 | — | — |\n| 512 | adamh-embed-init1 | 3.7995 (−0.011) | 404,592 | 0.997 | 1.051 |\n| 768 | baseline | 3.4339 | 273,532 | — | — |\n| 768 | adamh-embed-init1 | 3.4252 (−0.009) | 273,613 | 1.000 | 1.052 |\n\nComparison with AdamH embed at default init (init std=0.5/sqrt(d)):\n\n| Dim | Default init speedup | Init std=1.0 speedup |\n|-----|---------------------|---------------------|\n| 512 | 1.048 | 1.051 |\n| 768 | 1.040 | 1.052 |\n\nThe larger init slightly improves d768 (1.052 vs 1.040) while d512 is similar. Making RMSNorm a near-no-op at init gives a small but consistent benefit, especially at d768.\n\n**Verdict: PASS gate 1 (1.05× both scales).** Slightly better than default init at d768.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/4331424023/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/4346192244","html_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/issues/5203#issuecomment-4346192244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/5203","id":4346192244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLj5faM8AAAABAw2hdA","user":{"login":"ClassicLarry","id":42926649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTI2NjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42926649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry","html_url":"https://github.com/ClassicLarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T17:53:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T17:53:00Z","body":"🤖 **Gate 2 Results: AdamH embed with init std=1.0**\n\nAll 4 scales finished.\n\n| Scale | Budget | BL loss | Var loss | BL tps | Var tps | Speedup |\n|-------|--------|---------|----------|--------|---------|---------|\n| d512 | 2.19e17 | 3.8104 | 3.7995 | 407,378 | 406,205 | 1.051 |\n| d768 | 1.70e18 | 3.4339 | 3.4252 | 274,431 | 273,853 | 1.050 |\n| d1024 | 9.00e18 | 3.1605 | 3.1567 | 176,935 | 177,712 | 1.031 |\n| d1280 | 2.83e19 | 3.0065 | 3.0048 | 128,435 | 128,584 | 1.014 |\n\nScaling law (pinned α=0.0941):\n- Baseline A=94.98, Variant A=94.66\n- 1e21: baseline=2.6035, variant=2.6002\n- 1e23: baseline=2.2506, variant=2.2484\n\n**Gate 2: PASS** — speedup > 1 at all 4 scales and better projections at both 1e21 and 1e23. The improvement is strongest at small scale (~5%) and diminishes at larger scale (~1.4%), but remains positive throughout.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/4346192244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/4346365771","html_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/issues/5203#issuecomment-4346365771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/5203","id":4346365771,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLj5faM8AAAABAxBHSw","user":{"login":"ClassicLarry","id":42926649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTI2NjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42926649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry","html_url":"https://github.com/ClassicLarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T18:18:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T18:18:11Z","body":"std=1 is creating gradient norms below 0.001. Preferring the default AdamH approach over AdamH with init std=1.0.Gives identical performance, but has grad norms that don't become vanishingly small.\n\n<img width=\"881\" height=\"528\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3af94aae-a4a3-4598-a55a-a346403a32df\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/4346365771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]